@auth = http://localhost:11000
@render = http://localhost:11100
@instance = REPLACE_WITH_NONPRODUCTION_INSTANCE
@jwt = REPLACE_WITH_RETURNED_TOKEN
@template = REPLACE_WITH_CREATED_TEMPLATE_UUID

### Credentials are sent with the instance header. Capture response.token.
POST {{auth}}/api/v1/auth
Content-Type: application/json
instance: {{instance}}

{"email":"REPLACE_WITH_EMAIL","password":"REPLACE_WITH_PASSWORD"}

### Reuse JWT, not an x-api-key
GET {{render}}/api/v1/templates
instance: {{instance}}
x-auth-token: {{jwt}}

### Dataset definition
POST {{render}}/api/v1/datasets
Content-Type: application/json
instance: {{instance}}
x-auth-token: {{jwt}}

{"name":"demo-http-dataset","rootPath":"/data","schema":{},"sampleData":{"Person":{"Name":"Alex Rivera"}}}

### Render saved package template with XML. Template creation examples are
### generated from actual calls in the demo and examples/client.mjs.
POST {{render}}/api/v1/docx
Content-Type: application/json
instance: {{instance}}
x-auth-token: {{jwt}}

{"owner":"{{instance}}","uuid":"{{template}}","xml":"<data><Person><Name>Alex Rivera</Name></Person></data>","metadata":true}

### Form field discovery (encode PDF as base64; NOT multipart)
POST {{render}}/api/v1/pdf/forms/fields
Content-Type: application/json
instance: {{instance}}
x-auth-token: {{jwt}}

{"form":"REPLACE_WITH_BASE64_PDF"}

### Populate saved form wrapper; body contentType selects response mode
POST {{render}}/api/v1/pdf/forms
Content-Type: application/json
instance: {{instance}}
x-auth-token: {{jwt}}

{"owner":"{{instance}}","uuid":"{{template}}","xml":"<data><Person><Name>Alex Rivera</Name></Person></data>","contentType":"application/json"}

### Direct XSLT transformation is distinct from local JSON serialization
POST {{render}}/api/v1/xml
Content-Type: application/json
instance: {{instance}}
x-auth-token: {{jwt}}

{"xml":"<data><name>Alex</name></data>","xsl":"<xsl:stylesheet version=\"3.0\" xmlns:xsl=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/XSL/Transform\"><xsl:output method=\"text\"/><xsl:template match=\"/\"><xsl:value-of select=\"/data/name\"/></xsl:template></xsl:stylesheet>"}
